{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46126","headline":"送刘相公朝觐二首 二 · 贯休","name":"送刘相公朝觐二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"急徵祗是再登庸，生意人心万国同。\n燮理久徵殷傅说，谭真欲过李玄通。\n程穿岘首春光老，马速商於曙色红。\n从此龙颜又应瘦，寰瀛俱荷代天功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}